---
title: Transport & Logistics
lang: en
seoTitle: Transport & Logistics — Agitech
seoDescription: 'Odoo for transport and logistics: integrated TMS, drag-and-drop transport order planning, driver app and eCMR, waste collection, invoicing on actual weight.'
blocks:
- discriminant: innerHero
  value:
    title: Odoo for the sector of
    subTitle: Transport & Logistics
    bottomLine: true
    image: banner-bg-2.svg
- discriminant: caseIntro
  value:
    bgClass: lighter-gray-bg
    needsLabel: 'NEEDS'
    needs:
    - 'Transport orders (TMS)'
    - 'Drag-and-drop planning'
    - 'Driver app & eCMR'
    - 'Waste collection (DAP/BSD)'
    - 'Invoicing on actual weight'
    - 'Real-time KPIs'
    challengesLabel: 'THE CHALLENGES'
    challenge: '<p><strong>Transport managed outside the ERP:</strong> planning lives in Excel or on paper, disconnected from the sales order. The carrier has no real-time visibility and disputes are settled by phone.</p><p><strong>Double entry and data errors:</strong> transport orders are re-keyed by hand, creating gaps between orders, deliveries and invoices. Every error is a potential financial loss.</p><p><strong>Delayed invoicing:</strong> 5 to 7 days between delivery and invoice, quantity errors and no automatic reminders: cash flow suffers.</p><p><strong>Insufficient waste traceability:</strong> waste slips (BSD) and acceptance requests (DAP) handled manually, with no link between the collection order and the disposal site. A regulatory compliance risk.</p><p><strong>Several companies, no consolidated view:</strong> different entities and countries on disconnected tools make real-time steering impossible.</p>'
- discriminant: odooExpertise
  value:
    bgClass: white-bg
    title: 'Our solution for transport and logistics'
    items:
    - logo: box-add-outline-rounded.svg
      heading: 'TMS integrated with Odoo'
      descriptionPoints: '<p>Odoo remains the commercial source of truth, the TMS the transport one.</p><ul><li>Customer order automatically split into Delivery Orders</li><li>Real-time Odoo ↔ TMS API sync</li><li>Each DO broken down into transport orders (1 TO = 1 trip)</li><li>Rules per country and vehicle type (semi, rigid, convoy)</li></ul>'
    - logo: automation-outline.svg
      heading: 'Drag-and-drop planning'
      descriptionPoints: '<p>The dispatcher sees everything in one place.</p><ul><li>Unplanned orders on the left, trucks and drivers on the right</li><li>Each vehicle''s load visible at a glance</li><li>Own trucks first, subcontracting as a complement</li><li>Site delivery date protected</li></ul>'
    - logo: codage.png
      heading: 'Driver app & eCMR'
      descriptionPoints: '<p>The driver confirms delivery from their phone.</p><ul><li>Daily route and details of each delivery</li><li>Confirmation, photo and dispute reporting</li><li>Electronically signed eCMR, regulatory proof</li><li>Actual weight (weighbridge) sent back to Odoo</li></ul>'
    - logo: Material-icon.svg
      heading: 'Waste collection & traceability'
      descriptionPoints: '<p>Same logic as delivery, with the waste vocabulary.</p><ul><li>DAP submitted from the Odoo customer portal</li><li>Validation, then sales order and reception orders generated</li><li>Collection orders: skip drop, pick-up, swap</li><li>DAP → BSD traceability up to the disposal site</li></ul>'
    - logo: conseiller-financier.png
      heading: 'Automated invoicing & finance'
      descriptionPoints: '<p>No more re-keying: the invoice starts from the actual weight.</p><ul><li>Customer invoice generated each evening on validated deliveries</li><li>Carrier purchase order created automatically</li><li>Multi-company BE/FR, TGAP and Peppol e-invoicing</li><li>Reminders and outstanding tracking</li></ul>'
    - logo: analytique.png
      heading: 'Real-time steering & KPIs'
      descriptionPoints: '<p>Dashboards without any data entry.</p><ul><li>Tonnage, service rate and disputes</li><li>View by depot, vehicle and driver</li><li>Planned and in-progress orders, active disputes</li><li>Fleet tracking and preventive maintenance</li></ul>'
- discriminant: methodologies
  value:
    bgClass: white-bg
    title: 'From order to truck, with no double entry'
    description: ''
    methodologies:
    - heading: '① Order in Odoo'
      description: '<p>The customer orders N tonnes of materials or a waste collection service. On validation, Odoo splits the order into logistics slices: for example 300 T become 2 Delivery Orders of 150 T.</p>'
    - heading: '② Real-time sync'
      description: '<p>Each Delivery Order is sent automatically to the TMS through the API. The dispatcher sees it appear without typing anything.</p>'
    - heading: '③ Transport orders'
      description: '<p>The dispatcher (or the TMS) breaks each DO down into transport orders according to vehicle and availability: 150 T become 6 trips of 25 T. One order = one truck trip.</p>'
    - heading: '④ Delivery and invoicing'
      description: '<p>The driver validates, the eCMR is signed and the actual weight flows back into Odoo. The customer invoice and the carrier purchase order are generated automatically.</p>'
